### 怎么一步步搭建DataOps框架
1. Project workspace （JIRA， Teams Channel， Confluence， Repository， Roles， Environments）
2. Developer workspace （Local develop environment， debug tools，commit convention， code scan，vulnerability check，pr review，compliance check，deploy，test，document（versioning，badging））
3. Engineering workspace （data landing, data pipeline, data models, data apis, data monitor）
4. Batch / Streaming

&lt;img src='https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e7d49f3-f26d-4c62-9860-b0c5bf57be90' height='200'/&gt;

### 为什么要搞DataOps？
1. For leaders: Data governance - standardisation, federation, meshing
2. For developers &amp; engineers: collaboration, automation, maintenance

caveats:
1. Team working culture
2. Leader's aspiration
3. Have someone to sell up
4. Rome isn't build in one day, be patient
5. Getting early feedback is the key, form your alpha group of people and start a pilot project, test and iterate.
6. Agile - stakeholder (Product Owner, Project Manager, SME) continuous engagement.
7. DevOps practise。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/DataOps-de-yi-xie-xin-de.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 16:38:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>关于Senior Data Engineer的一些思考</title><link>https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/guan-yu-Senior%20Data%20Engineer-de-yi-xie-si-kao.html</link><description>最近几个月，由于工作内容的调整，做Data Engineering的时间占了较少的比重，主要工作重心都在platform这边，算是半个SRE了。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/guan-yu-Senior%20Data%20Engineer-de-yi-xie-si-kao.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 10:40:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Log Analytics Workspace（使用篇）</title><link>https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/Log%20Analytics%20Workspace%EF%BC%88-shi-yong-pian-%EF%BC%89.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/Log%20Analytics%20Workspace%EF%BC%88-shi-yong-pian-%EF%BC%89.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 10:30:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>API Management stv2（迁移篇）</title><link>https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/API%20Management%20stv2%EF%BC%88-qian-yi-pian-%EF%BC%89.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/API%20Management%20stv2%EF%BC%88-qian-yi-pian-%EF%BC%89.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 10:28:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>OSI层级是啥，咋弄，为啥</title><link>https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/OSI-ceng-ji-shi-sha-%EF%BC%8C-zha-nong-%EF%BC%8C-wei-sha.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/OSI-ceng-ji-shi-sha-%EF%BC%8C-zha-nong-%EF%BC%8C-wei-sha.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 09:56:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>PostgreSQL 总结 (运维篇)</title><link>https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/PostgreSQL%20-zong-jie-%20%28-yun-wei-pian-%29.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/PostgreSQL%20-zong-jie-%20%28-yun-wei-pian-%29.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 03:31:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>PostgreSQL 总结 (开发篇)</title><link>https://aiden-liu.github.io/post/